1
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:17,830
Enter.

2
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:26,290
So you've come.

3
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:32,500
Do you know why you were summoned?

4
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:33,920
Yes, my lord.

5
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:36,420
Then what of your connections
to Prince Ravisel?

6
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,630
I have cut ties with him.

7
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:43,420
You were unaware of the discord between
the royal family and the spirits.

8
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:47,580
I appreciate that you can't have imagined
what you did to be problematic.

9
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:53,330
However, because of your actions,
the royal family is now after Ellen.

10
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:03,380
Ellen told me to have a word with you...

11
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:08,130
Apparently, until I do,
she has no intention of speaking to me.

12
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:15,290
Do you understand why Ellen burned
the prince's letter without reading it?

13
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,880
Never mind what it said.

14
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:21,540
Now there's no evidence
it was really from His Highness,

15
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:26,460
or even that you delivered it
to Ellen in the first place.

16
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:31,920
Milady has saved me, hasn't she?

17
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:37,540
First my father saves you, and now
you're indebted to my daughter.

18
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:41,460
My deepest apologies.

19
00:01:44,210 --> 00:01:46,580
I'm restoring you as Sauvel's guard.

20
00:01:46,670 --> 00:01:47,710
What?!

21
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:50,380
Did you not hear me?

22
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:52,040
I-I did, my lord.

23
00:01:53,330 --> 00:01:56,920
However, I still can't fully trust you.

24
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:01,210
I'll be keeping my eye on you for a while.

25
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:02,830
Yes, my lord.

26
00:02:04,830 --> 00:02:06,380
Be grateful to Ellen.

27
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:19,080
Alberto!

28
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:31,920
Lord Barvel!

29
00:02:36,750 --> 00:02:37,830
I'll...

30
00:04:09,130 --> 00:04:10,170
GODDESS VÁR'S CONDEMNATION

31
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:13,750
Lady Ellen, would you like
me to refill your drink?

32
00:04:14,170 --> 00:04:16,630
Thank you, Pawpaw! Yes, please!

33
00:04:16,710 --> 00:04:18,580
Ellen!

34
00:04:20,210 --> 00:04:21,500
Lord Rovel.

35
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:25,710
Nothing?! Are you ignoring me, Ellen?

36
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:29,170
Did you speak with Alberto?

37
00:04:29,710 --> 00:04:32,670
Yes. I've lifted his suspension.

38
00:04:32,750 --> 00:04:34,830
So please at least look at me!

39
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:38,540
Could you please forgive your dear father?!

40
00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:40,460
Father.

41
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:41,830
Ellen!

42
00:04:42,250 --> 00:04:47,170
I think you should be more clear
with the people around you

43
00:04:47,250 --> 00:04:48,880
about what will and won't cause issues.

44
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:52,830
Humans and spirits have
different values, after all.

45
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,380
True...

46
00:04:54,710 --> 00:04:59,880
It's wrong of you to blame Uncle Alberto
after neglecting to do so!

47
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:02,460
Yes, ma'am.

48
00:05:04,170 --> 00:05:06,420
As long as you're reflecting
on your mistakes, you're good.

49
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:07,750
There. There.

50
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:09,420
Ellen!

51
00:05:10,250 --> 00:05:14,080
My, my. I can't tell which of you
is the parent here anymore.

52
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:18,960
I understand that you're
thinking of me, Father.

53
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:23,630
But if you're going to use me as bait,
please let me know in advance.

54
00:05:23,710 --> 00:05:27,420
I couldn't help taking it out on you.

55
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:29,580
It was a horrible punishment.

56
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:35,330
Now, we can think of how to deal
with Mr. Blackheart together, can't we?

57
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,750
Mr. Blackheart?

58
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:42,080
I mean Prince Ravisel, who is purely
evil at heart, sinister, and spiteful.

59
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:45,880
What a fitting description!

60
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:48,170
Just so you know, you are too, Father.

61
00:05:48,250 --> 00:05:49,290
How?!

62
00:05:50,790 --> 00:05:53,580
That's awful!
That's really awful of you, Ellen!

63
00:05:53,670 --> 00:05:56,130
Father, haven't you had enough?

64
00:05:56,210 --> 00:05:58,540
Oh, come on. Just a little longer.

65
00:05:58,630 --> 00:06:02,710
Now, now! Let us lighten the mood
a bit and have fun today!

66
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,420
Very good, Pawpaw!

67
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:11,540
Okay, let us show Lady Ellen our skills as
those who serve the knights on a daily basis!

68
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:12,830
Understood!

69
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:18,130
Nine, ten! Are you ready?!

70
00:06:18,580 --> 00:06:21,460
Come and find us, milady!

71
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:26,420
Now then, where could you all be hiding?

72
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:31,580
I'm going to find everyone right away!

73
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,130
Huh?

74
00:06:42,670 --> 00:06:43,880
Not here.

75
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:46,040
How about here?!

76
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:52,040
Not here either.

77
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:03,460
I can't find them...

78
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:07,460
Oh, drat! How could I let this happen?

79
00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:09,460
This simply won't do.

80
00:07:11,540 --> 00:07:12,880
Pawpaw!

81
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,420
Your pawpaw shall assist you.

82
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:16,540
Ah!

83
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:20,790
There!

84
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,790
Found you!

85
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:24,670
That's our Lady Ellen!

86
00:07:31,790 --> 00:07:33,040
Found you!

87
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:37,710
All right! Your father's going to help too!

88
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,960
Right here!

89
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:43,080
Here!

90
00:07:43,170 --> 00:07:44,880
Over there!

91
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:49,040
How's that, Ellen?

92
00:07:50,670 --> 00:07:53,210
I'm playing with Pawpaw and the others.

93
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,960
Father, please don't butt in!

94
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:58,830
I'm sorry, Ellen!

95
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:02,630
Could we play one more time?

96
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,960
Why, of course!

97
00:08:08,580 --> 00:08:12,880
Miss Ellen, can I please join in too?

98
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:16,750
Miss Ellen! Hey! Please, I beg you!

99
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:21,460
It's interesting to see so many
unexpected sides of Lord Rovel.

100
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:28,540
Indeed. Moreover, Ellen's presence
here brings such joy.

101
00:08:28,630 --> 00:08:30,420
Here I come!

102
00:08:33,250 --> 00:08:36,130
Grammie, can I come over and play again?

103
00:08:36,580 --> 00:08:39,670
Of course you can, Ellen!

104
00:08:39,750 --> 00:08:41,170
Come anytime.

105
00:08:41,250 --> 00:08:42,290
I will!

106
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,250
You too, Pawpaw!

107
00:08:52,290 --> 00:08:53,830
You're always welcome here.

108
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:56,170
Thank you very much!

109
00:08:57,290 --> 00:08:58,750
Uncle Alberto.

110
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,380
I'm so glad.

111
00:09:01,710 --> 00:09:06,290
If anything happens, be sure to consult
Uncle Sauvel about it, okay?

112
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:10,880
Thank you very much. I shall
never forget your kindness.

113
00:09:11,210 --> 00:09:13,250
You're overreacting.

114
00:09:13,330 --> 00:09:14,380
Hardly.

115
00:09:14,790 --> 00:09:17,880
At the very least, I want
to be able to convey my gratitude.

116
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,000
Okay then.

117
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:21,630
My!

118
00:09:21,710 --> 00:09:23,040
What about me?

119
00:09:23,130 --> 00:09:25,960
Ellen doesn't do well with beards, so...

120
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,580
Oh man.

121
00:09:27,670 --> 00:09:28,920
Ellen.

122
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:33,330
Now, your father has a few more
things to talk about with Sauvel,

123
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:35,330
so would you mind going on home without me?

124
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:39,080
Okay! Oh, and Uncle Sauvel!

125
00:09:49,170 --> 00:09:51,670
Our first order of business
is what to do with this.

126
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:53,420
How about using the suggested mine?

127
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:57,710
We could. However,
we'll need to look into it first.

128
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:58,880
True enough.

129
00:09:59,540 --> 00:10:02,250
Either way, you really saved me here.

130
00:10:02,330 --> 00:10:05,790
You spared our house from ruin
during my time as head of the family.

131
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:10,210
Ever since you came back, Brother...

132
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:12,830
It's like I've been on a lucky streak.

133
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:16,290
It's more that things have been
wrong until now, Your Grace.

134
00:10:17,210 --> 00:10:18,580
Besides that, Sauvel...

135
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:22,880
Why don't you hurry and invite your
beloved and your daughter here?

136
00:10:23,420 --> 00:10:25,130
Even Mother's curious.

137
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:28,250
I also believe that's a fine idea.

138
00:10:28,830 --> 00:10:32,380
So, who is this woman you fell in love with?

139
00:10:32,460 --> 00:10:33,630
About that...

140
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:38,630
She's the poster girl for an eatery
in town. Her name is Aria.

141
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:45,420
Our daughter's name is Rafilia.
She's about the same age as Ellen.

142
00:10:45,500 --> 00:10:46,670
Oh?

143
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:51,290
I used to dine there
with a few of the knights, and...

144
00:10:52,170 --> 00:10:55,630
She treated me kindly.

145
00:10:56,920 --> 00:11:01,330
Then please bring Lady Aria
to the house as soon as possible.

146
00:11:01,630 --> 00:11:03,420
Why in such a hurry?

147
00:11:03,750 --> 00:11:07,670
At present, Lady Ellen is the only
heir to the Vankreift family.

148
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:13,040
However, it is her duty to one day take
Lady Origin's place as spirit queen.

149
00:11:13,420 --> 00:11:19,580
We must make certain the royal family knows
the Vankreift family has a legitimate heir.

150
00:11:20,130 --> 00:11:22,210
Once Ravisel ascends to the throne,

151
00:11:22,290 --> 00:11:26,290
he may well issue a royal decree
forcing his son on Ellen.

152
00:11:26,540 --> 00:11:27,880
You're right.

153
00:11:28,630 --> 00:11:33,750
Normally, as a divorcé, I wouldn't be allowed
to marry for another three years.

154
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:38,540
The royal family has made an exception
due to the incident with Agiel,

155
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:41,130
so we can move with haste, but...

156
00:11:41,210 --> 00:11:43,880
What is there to ponder?

157
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:46,790
You mustn't keep your
love waiting any longer.

158
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:52,170
Sauvel, bring her and your
daughter here tomorrow.

159
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:54,750
Understood.

160
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:03,960
<i>Rovel and the spirit queen's daughter, huh?</i>

161
00:12:20,750 --> 00:12:24,290
Aria! Rafilia! You've made it.

162
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:25,500
Darling.

163
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,880
Brother, let me introduce you.

164
00:12:28,170 --> 00:12:32,130
This is Aria and my daughter, Rafilia.

165
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:35,960
I am Sauvel's older brother, Rovel.

166
00:12:36,710 --> 00:12:38,880
Brother dearest...

167
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:41,130
Please take good care of my brother.

168
00:12:41,210 --> 00:12:42,750
Y-Yes, my lord!

169
00:12:43,250 --> 00:12:45,210
Now then, let me show you around.

170
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,080
Aria?

171
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:51,080
Ah, coming!

172
00:13:16,330 --> 00:13:19,130
Oh, that's very delicious!

173
00:13:19,210 --> 00:13:20,380
Thank you very much.

174
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:23,830
It seems Aria will only be
inviting her relatives, so...

175
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:26,790
Wow!

176
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:32,830
Oh, Rafilia! Did you decide on your dress?

177
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:33,880
Uh-huh!

178
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,330
I'm glad to hear that.

179
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:43,710
It looks like Father is really helping
out Uncle Sauvel.

180
00:13:43,790 --> 00:13:45,250
Good, good.

181
00:13:45,330 --> 00:13:49,290
No, there's nothing good about this, Ellen.

182
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:51,420
Look! Look at what's happening!

183
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:55,500
Oh my, my...
But isn't this also helping Uncle?

184
00:14:00,750 --> 00:14:03,960
Ori, Ellen, I'm home.

185
00:14:06,040 --> 00:14:09,420
Huh? Ori, has something upset you?

186
00:14:09,710 --> 00:14:14,790
She's sulking because you were drinking
with women hanging all over you, Father.

187
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:15,960
What?!

188
00:14:16,250 --> 00:14:20,460
No! Um, uh, that upset me too, you know?!

189
00:14:20,540 --> 00:14:22,670
Father, you reek of alcohol!

190
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:28,130
Ori! I'm sorry. I <i>tried</i> running from them...

191
00:14:29,290 --> 00:14:30,960
I was watching, so I know.

192
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,920
Then...

193
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:36,500
You've been going out drinking a lot lately.

194
00:14:36,580 --> 00:14:38,710
I'm really sorry, Ori!

195
00:14:38,790 --> 00:14:41,210
From now on, I'll stay
with you as much as possible!

196
00:14:42,130 --> 00:14:43,500
Hmph, really?

197
00:14:43,580 --> 00:14:45,170
Yeah! I promise!

198
00:14:45,250 --> 00:14:46,630
Really, really?

199
00:14:46,710 --> 00:14:47,880
Really, really, really!

200
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:50,790
I'm turning in first.

201
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:55,130
Hold on! There's something I want
to talk to both of you about.

202
00:14:57,210 --> 00:15:00,000
Sauvel's wedding date has been decided.

203
00:15:00,330 --> 00:15:02,790
Most likely, the royal family will attend.

204
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:07,540
I'm sorry to ask this, Ellen,
but would you mind sitting it out?

205
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:11,380
That's fine. I do not wish
to meet Mr. Blackheart.

206
00:15:11,630 --> 00:15:14,790
Wait, so I'm allowed to attend?

207
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:19,380
I need let people to know that I'm married.

208
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:20,750
I see.

209
00:15:20,830 --> 00:15:26,960
Though I'd rather other men didn't
see how beautiful you are, Ori...

210
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,790
Oh my.

211
00:15:31,750 --> 00:15:34,080
Well then, good night!

212
00:15:36,710 --> 00:15:41,210
I see. So the royal family plans
to attend after all, huh?

213
00:15:41,710 --> 00:15:46,380
They have some nerve to come,
especially after what happened with Agiel.

214
00:15:47,380 --> 00:15:52,080
Well, you'll have to show off your
happiness to the fullest at the wedding.

215
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:53,420
Yes.

216
00:15:54,670 --> 00:15:57,710
Brother, will Ellen be...

217
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:02,290
Yeah. I'm sorry, but she'll
have to sit this one out.

218
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:07,500
I see. I'm certain Mother and Roren
will be disappointed.

219
00:16:07,580 --> 00:16:10,710
However, it would be best for Ellen not to come.

220
00:16:10,790 --> 00:16:13,000
I'm glad we're on the same page.

221
00:16:13,790 --> 00:16:14,880
Come in.

222
00:16:16,710 --> 00:16:19,130
Darling, I've brought some tea.

223
00:16:19,210 --> 00:16:20,290
What happened to Roren?

224
00:16:20,830 --> 00:16:24,880
I asked him if I could step in
and wouldn't take no for an answer.

225
00:16:25,170 --> 00:16:26,880
I'm always telling you...

226
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:29,290
You don't have to do all of this.

227
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,630
You mustn't take away their jobs.

228
00:16:31,710 --> 00:16:35,080
I'm sorry. I wanted to do it just this once.

229
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:47,290
B-Brother dearest, have some tea.

230
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:48,580
Oh, thank you.

231
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,920
Here you go.

232
00:16:55,710 --> 00:16:59,580
Thank you. You still have preparations
to make for tomorrow, don't you?

233
00:16:59,670 --> 00:17:00,750
You can go now.

234
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:03,580
Huh? All right...

235
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:10,960
Say, Ellen, sweetie...

236
00:17:11,290 --> 00:17:14,790
Between burning the world to a crisp
and plunging it into the ocean,

237
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,670
which do you think is better?

238
00:17:17,330 --> 00:17:18,710
Mother, please calm down!

239
00:17:18,790 --> 00:17:21,880
That woman is Uncle Sauvel's bride!

240
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:24,790
There's no way anything will
happen between her and Father!

241
00:17:26,170 --> 00:17:29,630
But... she is sort of beautiful, isn't she?

242
00:17:29,710 --> 00:17:32,040
Compared to you, Mother,
she's perfectly plain!

243
00:17:33,170 --> 00:17:36,500
Ellen, dear, is your mother
winning this battle?

244
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:38,330
A landslide victory, for sure!

245
00:17:40,670 --> 00:17:42,170
Thank you!

246
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:47,000
It's just that she's been
staring at him all this time.

247
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:54,790
Yeah. I'm sure Father's noticed too
and doesn't want to get involved with her.

248
00:17:55,830 --> 00:17:57,210
You're right.

249
00:18:01,750 --> 00:18:03,790
Oh, they've arrived.

250
00:18:04,330 --> 00:18:06,210
Yes, they're here.

251
00:18:09,330 --> 00:18:14,790
Wow! Father, you look handsome!
Mother, you look lovely!

252
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,330
Thank you.

253
00:18:18,670 --> 00:18:20,040
Okay, we'll see you later.

254
00:18:20,130 --> 00:18:23,380
Listen carefully, Ellen.
You mustn't come no matter what, okay?

255
00:18:23,460 --> 00:18:24,790
Okay!

256
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,630
Brother dearest! Oh...

257
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:36,420
Could this be your...

258
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:39,380
Sorry I haven't been able
to introduce you two sooner.

259
00:18:39,750 --> 00:18:41,330
This is my wife, Ori.

260
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:42,540
Nice to meet you.

261
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:49,790
Oh dear. She looks intimidated by Mother.

262
00:18:50,330 --> 00:18:55,080
I hope that this will stop her
from looking at Father like that...

263
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:57,170
This is my daughter, Rafilia.

264
00:18:57,540 --> 00:19:00,460
N-Nice to meet you.

265
00:19:00,540 --> 00:19:05,290
You look the same age as my daughter.
I do hope you'll be friends.

266
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:07,330
Y-Yes, ma'am.

267
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:21,670
Ori, take a look. It's the royal family.

268
00:19:22,710 --> 00:19:26,130
That's King Ravisel, who took the throne,
and Queen Lalar,

269
00:19:26,540 --> 00:19:32,330
followed by First Prince Gadiel,
Second Prince Rasel, and First Princess Ciel.

270
00:19:34,460 --> 00:19:37,670
The first prince seems rather clever.

271
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:41,670
Oh, it's not just Mr. Blackheart.

272
00:19:41,750 --> 00:19:44,580
These people have that black
stuff coming out of them too.

273
00:20:01,290 --> 00:20:06,880
Do you vow to love one another
in sickness and in health?

274
00:20:07,250 --> 00:20:08,460
I do.

275
00:20:09,290 --> 00:20:10,580
I do...

276
00:20:11,250 --> 00:20:13,790
Now, please sign the marriage certificate.

277
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,130
What happened? Are you all right?

278
00:20:25,210 --> 00:20:28,380
Y-Yes... I'm sorry for the sudden reaction.

279
00:20:28,750 --> 00:20:30,130
- No, it's all right, but...
- Dear.

280
00:20:30,210 --> 00:20:31,170
Yeah.

281
00:20:31,250 --> 00:20:34,040
There's no doubt that was
Goddess Vár's condemnation!

282
00:20:35,710 --> 00:20:38,380
Mr. Blackheart noticed it too!
What should we do?!

283
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:44,750
<i>If other people find out,</i>
<i>the marriage will be deemed invalid.</i>

284
00:20:44,830 --> 00:20:47,290
<i>If that were to happen,</i>
<i>rumors would spread</i>

285
00:20:47,830 --> 00:20:50,580
<i>that the Vankreift family has been</i>
<i>forsaken by the goddess.</i>

286
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:54,710
<i>There has to be a way to distract from this!</i>

287
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:56,960
<i>I know!</i>

288
00:21:00,710 --> 00:21:02,330
Are you sure you're all right?

289
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:12,500
Atomic number 6...

290
00:21:13,750 --> 00:21:14,960
Diamond!

291
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:22,880
How beautiful.

292
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:23,960
This is...

293
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:26,420
As expected of a Vankreift family wedding!

294
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:28,420
A blessing from the goddess!

295
00:21:31,830 --> 00:21:33,250
<i>What's going on?</i>

296
00:21:33,670 --> 00:21:37,250
<i>Could it be that Brother</i>
<i>asked the spirits for this?</i>

297
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:39,460
So pretty...

298
00:21:40,170 --> 00:21:42,170
Don't tell me it was Ellen...

299
00:21:46,830 --> 00:21:48,710
<i>Did it work out okay?</i>

300
00:21:49,250 --> 00:21:53,080
<i>Oh, looks like Father and Mother</i>
<i>figured me out.</i>

301
00:21:54,290 --> 00:21:56,460
Amazing, isn't it, Gadiel?

302
00:21:57,250 --> 00:22:00,330
This family has been blessed by the spirits.

303
00:22:00,420 --> 00:22:01,750
The spirits?

304
00:22:05,460 --> 00:22:09,630
<i>It seems like everything's good,</i>
<i>so I'd better head home now...</i>

305
00:22:21,170 --> 00:22:24,630
TRANSLATION: YUKARI MURASE-LOUDEN

306
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:28,330
EDITING: RILEY DALTON

307
00:22:28,710 --> 00:22:31,830
QUALITY CHECK: ASHLEY BARBOZA
TRANSLATION CHECK: ELIZABETH ELLIS

